[{"answer":"Parties can be a lot of fun.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/52-parties-2019-03-29-10-21-12/1.mp3"},{"answer":"People get invited to parties.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/52-parties-2019-03-29-10-21-12/2.mp3"},{"answer":"You can have a party because it is a special occasion,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/52-parties-2019-03-29-10-21-12/3.mp3"},{"answer":"or just because you want to have a party.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/52-parties-2019-03-29-10-21-12/4.mp3"},{"answer":"Sometimes, people wear paper hats at parties.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/52-parties-2019-03-29-10-21-12/5.mp3"},{"answer":"These are called party hats.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/52-parties-2019-03-29-10-21-12/6.mp3"},{"answer":"Some people decorate with streamers and balloons.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/52-parties-2019-03-29-10-21-12/7.mp3"},{"answer":"At some parties, there is a cake.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/52-parties-2019-03-29-10-21-12/8.mp3"},{"answer":"Sometimes, there are just snacks and drinks.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/52-parties-2019-03-29-10-21-12/9.mp3"},{"answer":"At some parties, people play games.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/52-parties-2019-03-29-10-21-12/10.mp3"},{"answer":"There are also parties where people just stand around and talk.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/52-parties-2019-03-29-10-21-12/11.mp3"},{"answer":"People wear different things to parties.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/52-parties-2019-03-29-10-21-12/12.mp3"},{"answer":"You can go to some parties in casual clothes.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/52-parties-2019-03-29-10-21-12/13.mp3"},{"answer":"At other parties, you need to be dressed up in good clothes.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/52-parties-2019-03-29-10-21-12/14.mp3"},{"answer":"There are other parties where you are supposed to wear a costume.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/52-parties-2019-03-29-10-21-12/15.mp3"},{"answer":"There are many different kinds of parties.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/52-parties-2019-03-29-10-21-12/16.mp3"},{"answer":"There are Christmas parties, birthday parties,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/52-parties-2019-03-29-10-21-12/17.mp3"},{"answer":"going away parties, and parties for no reason at all.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/52-parties-2019-03-29-10-21-12/18.mp3"},{"answer":"I have been to parties for people who are retiring,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/52-parties-2019-03-29-10-21-12/19.mp3"},{"answer":"or for people who have just had a new baby.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/52-parties-2019-03-29-10-21-12/20.mp3"},{"answer":"There are hundreds of reasons for having a party.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/52-parties-2019-03-29-10-21-12/21.mp3"},{"answer":"At some parties, you take a gift.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/52-parties-2019-03-29-10-21-12/22.mp3"},{"answer":"If it is a birthday party,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/52-parties-2019-03-29-10-21-12/23.mp3"},{"answer":"then you take a gift and a birthday card to the person who is having the birthday.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/52-parties-2019-03-29-10-21-12/24.mp3"},{"answer":"Sometimes, people will ask you to bring food or drinks to the party.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/52-parties-2019-03-29-10-21-12/25.mp3"},{"answer":"All parties are different.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/52-parties-2019-03-29-10-21-12/26.mp3"},{"answer":"It is nice to be invited to parties.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/52-parties-2019-03-29-10-21-12/27.mp3"}]
